              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "To endure? (భరించు, bhariñcu.) To crawl? (పాకు, pāku.) To bend down? (వంగు, vaṅgu.) To stretch out? (చాచు, cācu.) To stack? (పేర్చు, pērcu.) The palm of the hand? (అరచెయ్యి, araceyyi.) The heel? (మడమ, maḍama.) The ankle? (చీలమండ, cīlamaṇḍa.) The thigh? (తొడ, toḍa.) The waist? (నడుము, naḍumu.) The mind? (మనసు, manasu.) Breathlessness? (ఆయాసం, āyāsaṁ.) A muscle? (కండరం, kaṇḍaraṁ.) An injection? (ఇంజెక్షను, iñjekṣanu.) A vaccination? (టీకా, ṭīkā.) Ugadi? (ఉగాది, ugādi.) Diwali? (దీపావళి, dīpāvaḷi.) Dasara? (దసరా, dasarā.) Vinayaka Chavithi? (వినాయక చవితి, vināyaka caviti.) Bathukamma? (బతుకమ్మ, batukamma.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
